   "id": 501523,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Define the fields of magnetism and electricity and state how are they are related.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 985443,
     "content_html": "Magnetism describes the attractive force between a magnetized object and a metal like iron. Electricity involves the study of electric charges and their movements. Magnetism is not related to the electricity."
    },
    {
     "id": 985444,
     "content_html": "Magnetism describes the attractive force between a magnetized object and a metal like iron. Electricity involves the study of electric charges and their movements. Magnetism is produced by a flow electrical charges."
    },
